  "description": "The first lightweight, portable 2-up seat small EV. The MG Doble combines a full-sized bike design and a 2-up seat with JackRabbit’s signature lightweight portability (for example, easily lift this bad boy into any bike rack). With a 749W cargo-geared motor and a mullet wheel design, this Micro-Hauler™ was designed to get sh*t done on your own, or with a passenger.Armed with 20 mph of 100% electric speed, an unlockable 24 mph Off-Road Mode, 48+ miles of range, a color display, 2-piston hydraulic brakes, a twist throttle, Highrise Handlebars, front and back lights, front and rear fenders, and over 10 attach points, the MG Doble is ready for infinite missions. All of that - and the MG Doble clocks in at only 52 lbs, and can fold flat to fit anywhere in your life. Tested & compliant with UL2271 and UL2272. Ships almost fully assembled with charger and assembly tools.",
